                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.9"&gt;11.3.9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add &lt;code&gt;SaveFilePickerWithResultAsync&lt;/code&gt; API by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jmacato/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jmacato"&gt;@jmacato&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3493217781" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19783" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19783/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19783"&gt;#19783&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Primary mouse device by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/miloush/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/miloush"&gt;@miloush&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3544869926" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19898" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19898/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19898"&gt;#19898&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add an optional &lt;code&gt;ConvertBack&lt;/code&gt; method to &lt;code&gt;FuncValueConverter&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/zacfromaustinpowder/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/zacfromaustinpowder"&gt;@zacfromaustinpowder&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3554792338" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19920" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19920/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19920"&gt;#19920&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Support reading from and copying images to clipboard by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3557411161" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19930" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19930/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19930"&gt;#19930&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add &lt;code&gt;SuggestedFileType&lt;/code&gt; for Save/OpenFilePicker by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jmacato/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jmacato"&gt;@jmacato&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3607352809" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20026" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20026/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20026"&gt;#20026&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headless – Add headless &lt;code&gt;AvaloniaTestIsolationLevel&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3593530477" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20000" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20000/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20000"&gt;#20000&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build – Update &lt;code&gt;Avalonia.BuildServices&lt;/code&gt; package version by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3632789737" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20078" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20078/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20078"&gt;#20078&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Properly handle &lt;code&gt;DrawableRun.Baseline&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3544381729" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19896" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19896/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19896"&gt;#19896&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;Selector.ValidateNestingSelector&lt;/code&gt; not calling overrides by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/zacfromaustinpowder/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/zacfromaustinpowder"&gt;@zacfromaustinpowder&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3568586744" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19947" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19947/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19947"&gt;#19947&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Handle long file paths in &lt;code&gt;UriFromFilePath&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/startewho/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/startewho"&gt;@startewho&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3573674641" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19955" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19955/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19955"&gt;#19955&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;ServerCompositionSimplePen&lt;/code&gt; memory leak by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/aguahombre/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/aguahombre"&gt;@aguahombre&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3575226743" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19958" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19958/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19958"&gt;#19958&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Cache platform font manager &lt;code&gt;TryMatchCharacter&lt;/code&gt; result by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3585917265" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19987" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19987/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19987"&gt;#19987&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;EmbeddedFontCollection.TryGetNearestMatch&lt;/code&gt; caching by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3599766929" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20013" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20013/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20013"&gt;#20013&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Make &lt;code&gt;ContentPresenter.RecognizesAccessKey&lt;/code&gt; stylable by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3543596049" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19893" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19893/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19893"&gt;#19893&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previewer – Don't let the &lt;code&gt;PreviewerWindow&lt;/code&gt; be any size by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mrlacey/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mrlacey"&gt;@mrlacey&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3575026422" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19957" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19957/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19957"&gt;#19957&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android – Fix changes to &lt;code&gt;AccessibilityNodeInfoCompat.Checked&lt;/code&gt; data type from bool to int by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/BobbyCannon/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/BobbyCannon"&gt;@BobbyCannon&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3584083475" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19985" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19985/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19985"&gt;#19985&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android - Fix external app not reading text in clipboard by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3607007613" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20023" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20023/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20023"&gt;#20023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Fix fullscreen transitions with &lt;code&gt;ExtendClientAreaToDecorationsHint&lt;/code&gt; windows by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3561908143" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19939" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19939/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19939"&gt;#19939&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Fix XButtons event handler by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/DrunkyBard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/DrunkyBard"&gt;@DrunkyBard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3591149410" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19997" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19997/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19997"&gt;#19997&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Correct key mapping for scan code 0x18 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/snowflysky/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/snowflysky"&gt;@snowflysky&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3598559785" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20009" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20009/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20009"&gt;#20009&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Fix &lt;code&gt;TryCreateGlyphTypeface&lt;/code&gt; return on macOS with SkiaSharp 2.88 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3635015199" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20084" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20084/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20084"&gt;#20084&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
