&lt;li&gt;Windows – Fix &lt;code&gt;ComVariant&lt;/code&gt; native size (add extended field and asserts) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/AndreyRusyaev/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/AndreyRusyaev"&gt;@AndreyRusyaev&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3601136454" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20017" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20017/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20017"&gt;#20017&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Do not activate embedded windows when shown by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3607675236" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20027" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20027/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20027"&gt;#20027&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Properly snapshot &lt;code&gt;GlSkiaImportedImage&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3622295036" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20053" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20053/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20053"&gt;#20053&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
